Homepage: https://github.com/WireGuard/wireguard-go
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: wireguard-mc
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, systemd | systemd-sysv
Description: WireGuard userspace daemon with TCP + Minecraft camouflage
 Fork of wireguard-go that transports WireGuard over length-prefixed TCP
 with optional Minecraft protocol camouflage. Not compatible with kernel
 WireGuard or the stock UDP wireguard-go binary.
 .
 Installs the wireguard-go binary and example configs under /etc/wireguard.
 On upgrade, enabled wireguard-go@*.service instances are restarted automatically.
